# Manifest Contract — PlasticOS

A manifest must be valid Python. Every dependency must resolve to an Odoo addon or a `plasticos_*` module that exists. Cycles are rejected by `ci/check_circular_deps.py`.

Version format is `19.0.X.Y.Z`.

Runtime version bumps and the scoped `-u` upgrade are rule `89-plasticos-odoo-version-bump`.

## No Phantom Dependencies

`test_no_phantom_dependencies` rejects a `depends` name that is not an Odoo core addon or a `plasticos_*` module in this repo.

```python
# ❌ unknown module
"depends": ["plasticos_base", "some_nonexistent_module"]
```

## External Python Dependencies

Declare non-Odoo packages in `external_dependencies`:

```python
"external_dependencies": {"python": ["neo4j"]}
```

Manifests are Python dicts. Run `ruff format` after editing one.
